	(text "The BOARD_ID pins are used to determine the variant\nof Trellis hardware at boot, so Linux can correctly\ninitialize the peripherals for that board's \nconfiguration.\n\nThis is used so that we can release the official\nTrellis nerves system with compiled support for all\nofficial configurations of the hardware. \n\nIf you will compile and maintain a custom Nerves\nsystem for your project (recommended), then you may\nremove these pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 77.47 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "859dd7f1-8474-48be-8d5a-15338e030297")
	)
	(text "SD Flash Memory. If using eMMC, \nuse SDC2 on pins PC2-PC7"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 77.47 128.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "94d17823-f2fb-4a7d-8508-653e00fe94db")
	)
	(text "Debug console on UART4. It can also\nbe defined on other UARTs, but software \nsupport may vary"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c21e0b33-adf0-4f35-914a-181fcc9b0588")
	)
	(text "BOOT_SEL pins are used to select the boot priority\n\nBOOT_SEL1 | BOOT_SEL0 | Boot mode\n----------|-----------|---------------------------\n    0     |     0     | SPI NOR -> SPI NAND\n    0     |     1     | SMHC0 -> SPI NOR -> Other\n    1     |     0     | SMHC0 -> SPI NAND -> Other\n    1     |     1     | SMHC0 -> eMMC -> Other\n\nPull up resistor values may be changed as necessary"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 49.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Monaco")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cadd6a40-e820-4ebd-b594-04712ee2ec31")
	)
	(text "Claimed BOARD_IDs\n\n 1 | 2 | 3 | Device\n---|---|---|------------------------------------\n 0 | 0 | 0 | Trellis Dev Kit\n 0 | 0 | 1 | Nerves Getting Started Hardware Kit\n \n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Monaco")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d7336ad9-455e-44c9-bd6f-44f1960fab5b")
	)
	(text "See datasheet section 4.3 \"GPIO Multiplex\" (link)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 151.13 21.59 0)
		(effects
